{"id":"450095985","kind":"article","title":"笔记写作实践大多是无效的","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8V2q398qu89vdJ73N2BEYCgevMqux3yxQUAC"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2022-01-01","updated":"2025-07-24","votes":23,"comment_count":3,"minutes":1,"chars":617,"keywords":["常青笔记","笔记写作","知识工作","思考"],"summary":"短文指出，知识工作需要累积思考，但多数人只写临时笔记；由于缺少反馈，人们难以发现笔记实践无效并停留在基础技巧。作者认为，改进核心不是“更好地记笔记”，而是“更好地思考”。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/450095985","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"RENrEN_H\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6UDDkom8Aifg6mLdjT1sPtbMBweCmpyTwmJT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">知识工作应能聚沙成塔</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，但<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2ZAGQBHuJ2u9WrtAQHAEHcCZTtqpsGkAsrD1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大多数人只写临时的笔记</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"7Xq1maar\">部分原因是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z66PNF1Wt4AZ4j7TVEenkvPZgvDcHPuSdJC2r\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">笔记写作的反馈不足</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>，人们甚至没有注意到他们的笔记写作实践是多么的无效。他们发展了一些基本的笔记写作技巧，并大多停留在那里（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5gHroEM2vM2WcKxkdcsCw8qv5tmHSbBVxEb4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">人们通常把技能发展到一个平台期，然后就停下来</a>）。专业的表现没有得到很好的定义，所以人们表现不佳的情况并不明显（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3TLgRqbKq1iQvYNvxenccLPZUuJNB329uwGw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">改善的显著性推动了技能的发展</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>）。所有这些对其他核心知识工作技能来说也是如此：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7z6uFero1JXyANDsq7P4RzeUemPWrHD7Ejmn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">知识工作的核心实践往往是临时性的</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"MNcQJ-tb\">许多关于试图改善这些实践的文章都被误导了：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7kEFe6NfUSgtaDuUjST1oczKKzQQeQWk4Dbc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「更好地记笔记」这个描述太过流于表面；核心在于「更好地思考」</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup></p><p data-pid=\"3pv0YEZW\">相比之下：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3SjnvsB5aR2ddsycyXofbYR7fCxo7RmKW2be\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"SodecpXp\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"428784607\" href=\"#/post/428784607\">常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位</a></li><li data-pid=\"ljbVrJm_\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"427460683\" href=\"#/post/427460683\">「更好地记笔记」这个描述太过流于表面；核心在于「更好地思考」</a></li><li data-pid=\"o06ewZXW\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"423996524\" href=\"#/post/423996524\">大多数人只写临时的笔记</a></li><li data-pid=\"3WzIeo42\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"450488015\" href=\"#/post/450488015\">笔记写作的反馈不足</a></li><li data-pid=\"IVc7sSIp\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"451515311\" href=\"#/post/451515311\">多数人的阅读成效不大</a></li><li data-pid=\"QYE4U2jB\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"574272825\" href=\"#/post/574272825\">相比知识工作者，运动员和音乐家会更为严格精细地打磨基本技能</a></li><li data-pid=\"1YUNqGZ_\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"609604620\" href=\"#/post/609604620\">卡片笔记写作法 - Ahrens</a></li><li data-pid=\"5h9XEzoe\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1929184582483285376\" href=\"#/post/1929184582483285376\">采用朴素方法的练习会让人迅速遭遇瓶颈期</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"EXe-X8pe\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"9KDIZx4Z\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8V2q398qu89vdJ73N2BEYCgevMqux3yxQUAC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Note-writing practices are generally ineffective (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 知识工作应能聚沙成塔 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"422894427\" href=\"#/post/422894427\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 大多数人只写临时的笔记 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"423996524\" href=\"#/post/423996524\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 笔记写作的反馈不足 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"450488015\" href=\"#/post/450488015\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 对进步的直观感知驱动技能发展 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"554203902\" href=\"#/post/554203902\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 知识工作的核心实践往往是临场发挥的 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"580693228\" href=\"#/post/580693228\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 「更好地记笔记」这个描述太过流于表面；核心在于「更好地思考」 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"427460683\" href=\"#/post/427460683\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 常青笔记写作是知识工作的基本单位 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"428784607\" href=\"#/post/428784607\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"451515311","title":"多数人的阅读成效不大","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"452746461","title":"反向营销","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"427460683","title":"「更好地记笔记」这个描述太过流于表面；核心在于「更好地思考」","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"609604620","title":"卡片笔记写作法 - Ahrens","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":18,"minutes":12,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"423996524","title":"大多数人只写临时的笔记","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":31,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2772990761","title":"如何构建自己的笔记系统？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":755,"minutes":20,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 755 赞同","evidence":"回答以锚文本「笔记写作实践大多是无效的」直接指向目标译文；该锚文本是可辨认的标题或主题词。"},{"id":"3366385830","title":"卡片笔记写作法是否被过誉了？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":132,"minutes":5,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 132 赞同","evidence":"回答以可辨识的目标译文标题或关键词链接指向该译文；此处对应的是大纲条目/卡片标题。"},{"id":"3502489179","title":"快乐学习和刻意练习哪个更科学？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":107,"minutes":12,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 107 赞同","evidence":"回答正文有明确指向该译文的知乎内链/链接卡，按直接提及记为1级。"},{"id":"2446038124","title":"书看完很快就不记得具体内容了，所以读书的意义是什么呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":25,"minutes":5,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 25 赞同","evidence":"正文链接锚文本明确指向该译文标题或具体关键词。"},{"id":"2831205170","title":"记笔记真的有用吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":174,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸提及 · 174 赞同","evidence":"回答连续复现目标译文关于笔记反馈不足、技能停滞和表现难评估的正文段落。"}]}